# ~/.gitignore_global ignores docs/ (pattern on line 17). Repo-level patterns win,
# so re-include it here — otherwise design docs under docs/ silently never appear
# in git status. Verified with: git check-ignore --no-index docs/design/*.md
!docs/

# Scratch space for staged downloads and QA renders (AGENTS.md: temp files live here).
/.tmp/
